{"status": "ok", "language": null, "cues": [{"t": 1.13, "d": 2.4, "text": "大家好呀"}, {"t": 3.7, "d": 5.3, "text": "今天我想教大家10个中国人经常说"}, {"t": 9.0, "d": 4.83, "text": "但是在课本上却学不到的表达"}, {"t": 14.0, "d": 3.13, "text": "感兴趣的就往下看吧"}, {"t": 17.27, "d": 1.8, "text": "第一个"}, {"t": 24.87, "d": 3.13, "text": "在课本上，你可能会学到"}, {"t": 28.0, "d": 1.33, "text": "“我很累”"}, {"t": 29.33, "d": 1.37, "text": "“我非常累”"}, {"t": 30.7, "d": 1.83, "text": "“我累死了”"}, {"t": 32.67, "d": 2.07, "text": "但是在生活当中"}, {"t": 34.73, "d": 3.33, "text": "你可能会听到别人这样说"}, {"t": 38.07, "d": 3.73, "text": "“哎呀，今天我真的是累成狗了！”"}, {"t": 41.8, "d": 4.3, "text": "累成狗，累得跟狗一样"}, {"t": 46.33, "d": 2.2, "text": "这不是在骂人"}, {"t": 48.53, "d": 3.43, "text": "这只是一种夸张的表达"}, {"t": 52.33, "d": 2.93, "text": "假如你是一个上班族"}, {"t": 55.27, "d": 3.5, "text": "今天是你非常忙碌的一天"}, {"t": 58.77, "d": 2.27, "text": "从早上到下午"}, {"t": 61.03, "d": 1.67, "text": "一直有会议"}, {"t": 62.73, "d": 3.3, "text": "你一直要开会开会开会"}, {"t": 66.13, "d": 2.7, "text": "你就可以跟你的朋友抱怨"}, {"t": 68.97, "d": 2.77, "text": "“啊，我今天真的累成狗了！”"}, {"t": 71.93, "d": 3.97, "text": "你的朋友就会立刻明白你今天有多累"}, {"t": 76.3, "d": 2.37, "text": "第二个表达就是"}, {"t": 84.37, "d": 3.53, "text": "在课本上，你可能学到的是"}, {"t": 88.1, "d": 1.6, "text": "“我很开心”"}, {"t": 89.7, "d": 1.43, "text": "“我很高兴”"}, {"t": 91.13, "d": 2.43, "text": "“今天真的太好了”"}, {"t": 93.8, "d": 1.97, "text": "但是在生活当中"}, {"t": 95.77, "d": 2.17, "text": "中国人经常会说"}, {"t": 97.93, "d": 1.77, "text": "“哇，太爽了！”"}, {"t": 100.1, "d": 5.93, "text": "表示特别开心、特别满足、特别舒服的意思"}, {"t": 106.37, "d": 1.0, "text": "举个例子"}, {"t": 107.37, "d": 1.8, "text": "现在是夏天嘛"}, {"t": 109.17, "d": 3.17, "text": "气温都很高，很炎热"}, {"t": 112.47, "d": 1.03, "text": "你想一想"}, {"t": 113.5, "d": 4.67, "text": "在夏天，下午最炎热的时候"}, {"t": 118.57, "d": 2.73, "text": "35度，36度"}, {"t": 121.3, "d": 2.43, "text": "很热很热的天气"}, {"t": 123.9, "d": 4.2, "text": "你突然喝到了一杯冰咖啡"}, {"t": 128.1, "d": 2.07, "text": "或者冰奶茶"}, {"t": 130.17, "d": 2.23, "text": "或者冰啤酒"}, {"t": 135.83, "d": 4.2, "text": "“啊！太爽了！”"}, {"t": 140.63, "d": 4.77, "text": "就是说你很满足、很舒服、很开心的意思"}, {"t": 145.67, "d": 1.4, "text": "再举个例子"}, {"t": 147.07, "d": 3.0, "text": "如果你放一个星期假"}, {"t": 150.4, "d": 2.07, "text": "一个星期不用上班"}, {"t": 152.47, "d": 3.9, "text": "你是不是也会说“太爽了”"}, {"t": 157.1, "d": 2.3, "text": "第三个表达就是"}, {"t": 165.9, "d": 2.5, "text": "这个表达比较长"}, {"t": 168.4, "d": 6.8, "text": "它是表示非常紧张、非常慌张这样一个状态"}, {"t": 175.47, "d": 3.17, "text": "在课本上，你学到的可能是"}, {"t": 178.63, "d": 1.1, "text": "“我很紧张”"}, {"t": 179.73, "d": 1.57, "text": "“我很慌张”"}, {"t": 181.3, "d": 2.1, "text": "但在现实生活当中"}, {"t": 183.4, "d": 1.9, "text": "很多人会这样说"}, {"t": 185.3, "d": 2.9, "text": "“我内心慌得一批”"}, {"t": 189.6, "d": 2.07, "text": "“慌”是“慌张”的意思"}, {"t": 191.67, "d": 2.87, "text": "“得一批”，其实它没有什么意思"}, {"t": 194.53, "d": 3.3, "text": "只是加强语气"}, {"t": 198.07, "d": 2.0, "text": "给大家一个情景"}, {"t": 200.07, "d": 2.17, "text": "你刚学习中文不久"}, {"t": 202.27, "d": 3.1, "text": "第一次跟中国人聊天"}, {"t": 205.37, "d": 2.83, "text": "他说特别快的中文"}, {"t": 208.2, "d": 1.27, "text": "你很紧张"}, {"t": 209.47, "d": 1.37, "text": "你很慌张"}, {"t": 210.83, "d": 1.4, "text": "你就可以说"}, {"t": 212.23, "d": 4.13, "text": "“啊，那个时候其实我内心慌得一批！”"}, {"t": 216.5, "d": 1.63, "text": "我一直觉得"}, {"t": 218.13, "d": 2.17, "text": "大家学中文的时候"}, {"t": 220.3, "d": 5.93, "text": "应该要学一些真实的、自然的、地道的表达"}, {"t": 226.23, "d": 3.03, "text": "这就是为什么我一直推荐大家"}, {"t": 229.27, "d": 2.1, "text": "学习中文的过程当中"}, {"t": 231.37, "d": 3.67, "text": "一定一定要跟母语者练习对话"}, {"t": 235.03, "d": 1.5, "text": "那在这方面呢"}, {"t": 236.53, "d": 3.8, "text": "italki真的帮了我们一个很大的忙"}, {"t": 311.7, "d": 2.83, "text": "你可以一节课一节课地买"}, {"t": 314.53, "d": 3.6, "text": "不需要一下子囤很多的课"}, {"t": 318.13, "d": 2.0, "text": "时间也是比较灵活的"}, {"t": 320.13, "d": 3.0, "text": "这样你的压力就会小很多"}, {"t": 323.33, "d": 2.17, "text": "如果你是新用户"}, {"t": 325.5, "d": 6.7, "text": "现在用我的优惠码就能买10美金减5美金"}, {"t": 332.33, "d": 2.27, "text": "这个真的是很大的优惠了"}, {"t": 334.63, "d": 3.9, "text": "希望可以帮助到大家学习中文"}, {"t": 341.93, "d": 3.37, "text": "第四个表达方式就是"}, {"t": 347.23, "d": 5.97, "text": "牛，对，就是那个动物，牛"}, {"t": 353.2, "d": 4.47, "text": "在中国，“牛”也可以用来形容一个人很厉害"}, {"t": 357.67, "d": 2.1, "text": "做得很好的意思"}, {"t": 359.77, "d": 3.77, "text": "在课本上，你可能学到的表达方式是"}, {"t": 363.53, "d": 1.73, "text": "“你很棒！”"}, {"t": 365.33, "d": 3.73, "text": "但是中国人经常会在生活当中说"}, {"t": 369.07, "d": 1.9, "text": "“牛！”“太牛了！”"}, {"t": 370.97, "d": 5.03, "text": "如果你的朋友第一次参加马拉松长跑"}, {"t": 376.23, "d": 1.8, "text": "他拿了第一名"}, {"t": 378.03, "d": 2.03, "text": "你说他牛不牛"}, {"t": 380.07, "d": 3.13, "text": "你肯定会给他竖起大拇指"}, {"t": 383.2, "d": 2.03, "text": "说一句“太牛了！”"}, {"t": 385.87, "d": 2.73, "text": "第五个表达方式就是"}, {"t": 395.67, "d": 1.63, "text": "塌下来了"}, {"t": 397.43, "d": 2.73, "text": "那就是出事的意思"}, {"t": 400.17, "d": 3.27, "text": "出事了，出的还不是小事"}, {"t": 403.43, "d": 2.47, "text": "出大事了"}, {"t": 406.0, "d": 2.97, "text": "就是表达事情非常地严重"}, {"t": 409.1, "d": 3.97, "text": "当然有的时候也可以是开玩笑"}, {"t": 413.13, "d": 1.8, "text": "夸张地开玩笑"}, {"t": 415.03, "d": 1.73, "text": "可能事情没有那么严重"}, {"t": 416.77, "d": 3.37, "text": "但是我可以说得更夸张一点"}, {"t": 420.13, "d": 1.1, "text": "天塌了"}, {"t": 421.23, "d": 1.43, "text": "天塌下来了"}, {"t": 424.23, "d": 2.6, "text": "我给大家一个情景"}, {"t": 427.67, "d": 1.57, "text": "上厕所的时候"}, {"t": 429.23, "d": 3.67, "text": "你们有没有习惯刷手机呀"}, {"t": 432.9, "d": 2.33, "text": "有没有刷手机的习惯"}, {"t": 435.37, "d": 3.03, "text": "我应该是不止一次"}, {"t": 438.83, "d": 2.3, "text": "上厕所的时候刷手机"}, {"t": 441.13, "d": 2.73, "text": "然后起来的时候，“扑通”"}, {"t": 443.93, "d": 3.43, "text": "手机掉进马桶里了"}, {"t": 447.53, "d": 4.17, "text": "那个时候我就觉得天塌了"}, {"t": 451.7, "d": 3.73, "text": "天塌了，我的手机掉马桶了"}, {"t": 455.43, "d": 2.0, "text": "天真的塌了"}, {"t": 458.57, "d": 1.5, "text": "大家学会了吗"}, {"t": 460.3, "d": 2.53, "text": "第六个表达方式"}, {"t": 468.2, "d": 4.0, "text": "这里的“服了”不是“佩服”的意思"}, {"t": 472.23, "d": 2.23, "text": "是发生了一些事情"}, {"t": 474.47, "d": 3.03, "text": "让你感觉特别地无语"}, {"t": 477.63, "d": 2.33, "text": "给大家一个例子"}, {"t": 480.1, "d": 2.5, "text": "如果你有一个室友"}, {"t": 482.9, "d": 1.93, "text": "他经常忘记带钥匙"}, {"t": 484.9, "d": 3.8, "text": "你们的门需要钥匙才能打开"}, {"t": 488.97, "d": 2.0, "text": "他第一次忘记带钥匙"}, {"t": 490.97, "d": 1.47, "text": "他给你打电话"}, {"t": 492.57, "d": 4.2, "text": "啊对不起，我的钥匙落在公司了"}, {"t": 496.77, "d": 3.03, "text": "你可以回来帮我开一下门吗"}, {"t": 500.43, "d": 3.73, "text": "那你肯定...嗯没关系，我可以去帮他对不对"}, {"t": 504.17, "d": 2.53, "text": "因为这是第一次发生的情况"}, {"t": 506.7, "d": 2.73, "text": "那如果接下来一个星期"}, {"t": 509.43, "d": 4.0, "text": "他连续发生了三次这样的情况"}, {"t": 513.67, "d": 2.67, "text": "你就会有点觉得无语"}, {"t": 516.33, "d": 2.53, "text": "怎么这么没有记性呢"}, {"t": 518.87, "d": 1.8, "text": "我真的服了"}, {"t": 520.67, "d": 3.57, "text": "一个星期内发生了三次这样的情况"}, {"t": 524.33, "d": 2.1, "text": "“我真的服了！”"}, {"t": 526.87, "d": 4.03, "text": "接下来第七个表达就是"}, {"t": 535.7, "d": 3.53, "text": "对，中间有三个英文字母"}, {"t": 539.23, "d": 3.63, "text": "EMO来自英文词emotion"}, {"t": 543.0, "d": 4.2, "text": "它表示的是难过、伤心"}, {"t": 547.2, "d": 3.17, "text": "失落、心情不好的意思"}, {"t": 550.63, "d": 2.83, "text": "在课本上，你可能学的是"}, {"t": 553.47, "d": 1.73, "text": "“我很伤心”"}, {"t": 555.2, "d": 1.43, "text": "“我很难过”"}, {"t": 556.63, "d": 2.03, "text": "“我心情不好”"}, {"t": 558.67, "d": 2.93, "text": "但是现实生活当中"}, {"t": 561.6, "d": 1.57, "text": "特别是年轻人"}, {"t": 563.17, "d": 5.73, "text": "他们很喜欢用“我EMO啦！”这样的表达方式"}, {"t": 569.2, "d": 1.77, "text": "我有个朋友"}, {"t": 570.97, "d": 2.67, "text": "我经常会叫他Emo哥"}, {"t": 573.63, "d": 1.1, "text": "为什么"}, {"t": 574.73, "d": 3.97, "text": "因为他经常在晚上的时候就emo了"}, {"t": 578.97, "d": 2.67, "text": "在晚上不愿意睡觉"}, {"t": 581.63, "d": 2.1, "text": "听着悲伤的歌"}, {"t": 583.73, "d": 2.67, "text": "看着手机里的消息"}, {"t": 586.57, "d": 3.1, "text": "伤心、难过、失落"}, {"t": 589.8, "d": 5.03, "text": "然后就会发一些很悲伤的动态"}, {"t": 594.97, "d": 2.0, "text": "他非常喜欢EMO"}, {"t": 596.97, "d": 2.9, "text": "所以我给他取了个名字，叫“emo哥”"}, {"t": 600.03, "d": 3.8, "text": "来到第8个表达方式了"}, {"t": 608.63, "d": 2.5, "text": "你可能会问：有东西？"}, {"t": 611.23, "d": 1.73, "text": "有什么东西"}, {"t": 613.47, "d": 1.6, "text": "这句话的意思呢"}, {"t": 615.07, "d": 6.57, "text": "其实它是表达不错、比想象中好这样的意思"}, {"t": 621.93, "d": 2.03, "text": "有点东西"}, {"t": 624.17, "d": 4.07, "text": "有一天，你的朋友带你去了一家餐厅"}, {"t": 628.57, "d": 2.03, "text": "你其实没有什么期待"}, {"t": 630.6, "d": 5.2, "text": "那家餐厅它的样子也是比较普通的"}, {"t": 635.8, "d": 1.27, "text": "你坐下来"}, {"t": 637.07, "d": 2.03, "text": "然后点菜"}, {"t": 639.23, "d": 2.8, "text": "上菜、你尝了一口"}, {"t": 643.57, "d": 1.2, "text": "惊艳到了"}, {"t": 644.77, "d": 2.23, "text": "比你想象中的要好"}, {"t": 648.2, "d": 1.57, "text": "还挺不错的"}, {"t": 649.77, "d": 0.9, "text": "还挺好的"}, {"t": 650.67, "d": 1.47, "text": "挺厉害的"}, {"t": 652.13, "d": 1.53, "text": "你就可以说"}, {"t": 653.67, "d": 2.47, "text": "“哎，这家店有点东西哦！”"}, {"t": 656.53, "d": 2.5, "text": "这家店有点东西"}, {"t": 659.53, "d": 2.97, "text": "第九个表达方式"}, {"t": 665.53, "d": 3.4, "text": "或者是对......上头"}, {"t": 669.4, "d": 2.57, "text": "上头"}, {"t": 673.27, "d": 1.03, "text": "它的意思呢"}, {"t": 674.3, "d": 4.27, "text": "就是代表喜欢、上瘾这样的意思"}, {"t": 678.57, "d": 2.23, "text": "上头"}, {"t": 680.93, "d": 1.6, "text": "现在啊，TikTok"}, {"t": 682.53, "d": 1.63, "text": "很多人对Tiktok上头"}, {"t": 684.17, "d": 4.27, "text": "因为刷视频是一种很上头的行为"}, {"t": 688.43, "d": 2.9, "text": "很容易上瘾的行为"}, {"t": 691.43, "d": 1.7, "text": "这个是“上头”"}, {"t": 693.13, "d": 3.43, "text": "我已经刷了一晚上的手机了"}, {"t": 696.57, "d": 1.87, "text": "我停不下来"}, {"t": 698.43, "d": 1.9, "text": "太上头了"}, {"t": 700.33, "d": 3.33, "text": "短视频太让人上头了"}, {"t": 703.8, "d": 1.93, "text": "那如果你说"}, {"t": 705.73, "d": 5.6, "text": "“我现在对他上头了！”"}, {"t": 711.57, "d": 0.97, "text": "那是什么意思"}, {"t": 712.53, "d": 4.6, "text": "那就是你现在非常喜欢这个人的意思"}, {"t": 717.23, "d": 2.2, "text": "你对他很着迷"}, {"t": 719.43, "d": 1.33, "text": "你很喜欢他"}, {"t": 720.77, "d": 2.1, "text": "我对他上头了"}, {"t": 722.97, "d": 1.23, "text": "会用了吗"}, {"t": 724.43, "d": 1.33, "text": "最后一个"}, {"t": 730.67, "d": 5.23, "text": "大家可能看到这里又有一个英文词-CPU"}, {"t": 736.77, "d": 4.67, "text": "你们知道CPU它是电脑的一个零部件吗"}, {"t": 741.43, "d": 2.07, "text": "中央处理器"}, {"t": 743.73, "d": 3.97, "text": "烧，不是用火烧这样的意思"}, {"t": 747.77, "d": 3.33, "text": "是损坏了，不能用了这个意思"}, {"t": 751.1, "d": 1.5, "text": "CPU烧了"}, {"t": 752.6, "d": 2.23, "text": "如果你电脑的CPU坏了"}, {"t": 754.83, "d": 2.1, "text": "电脑是不能用的"}, {"t": 757.0, "d": 2.03, "text": "对，用不了了"}, {"t": 759.17, "d": 1.43, "text": "那在生活当中"}, {"t": 760.6, "d": 2.07, "text": "我们说这句话的时候呢"}, {"t": 762.87, "d": 2.13, "text": "除了可以用在电脑方面"}, {"t": 765.0, "d": 4.07, "text": "也可以用在你的脑子上"}, {"t": 770.0, "d": 1.17, "text": "什么意思"}, {"t": 771.17, "d": 5.33, "text": "CPU烧了，就是一些很费脑、很烧脑"}, {"t": 776.57, "d": 1.23, "text": "很复杂的情况"}, {"t": 777.8, "d": 1.43, "text": "你想不明白"}, {"t": 779.23, "d": 2.63, "text": "你就可以用“CPU烧了”（这个表达）"}, {"t": 782.17, "d": 1.2, "text": "举个例子"}, {"t": 783.37, "d": 3.27, "text": "你有一个程序员的朋友"}, {"t": 786.63, "d": 3.6, "text": "他很擅长写一些代码"}, {"t": 790.23, "d": 3.23, "text": "但是代码对你来说是非常难的"}, {"t": 793.47, "d": 3.53, "text": "像天书一样看不懂"}, {"t": 797.17, "d": 1.4, "text": "他给你讲"}, {"t": 798.57, "d": 1.03, "text": "这个是为什么"}, {"t": 799.6, "d": 1.3, "text": "这个是为什么"}, {"t": 800.9, "d": 2.0, "text": "你也很认真地听"}, {"t": 802.9, "d": 2.67, "text": "但是你就是不明白"}, {"t": 805.57, "d": 1.13, "text": "想不明白"}, {"t": 806.7, "d": 2.37, "text": "脑子转不过来了"}, {"t": 809.07, "d": 2.0, "text": "哎呀，不要再跟我说了"}, {"t": 811.07, "d": 2.47, "text": "我CPU烧了"}, {"t": 813.77, "d": 3.57, "text": "它想表达的意思就是想不明白"}, {"t": 817.33, "d": 1.93, "text": "脑子转不过来"}, {"t": 819.27, "d": 3.57, "text": "但是这是一个非常生动的表达"}, {"t": 822.93, "d": 3.57, "text": "如果你的中国朋友听到你说这句话"}, {"t": 826.5, "d": 2.23, "text": "他肯定会被你逗笑的"}, {"t": 829.07, "d": 4.2, "text": "今天的10个表达你都学会了吗"}, {"t": 833.27, "d": 3.13, "text": "马上找机会跟你的中国朋友"}, {"t": 836.4, "d": 5.13, "text": "或者跟你的中文老师说这几个词"}, {"t": 841.63, "d": 3.1, "text": "看看他们的反应是怎么样的"}, {"t": 845.47, "d": 2.1, "text": "如果大家想学习更多"}, {"t": 847.57, "d": 3.47, "text": "这样真实、自然、地道的中文"}, {"t": 851.03, "d": 2.47, "text": "请给我一个赞"}, {"t": 853.63, "d": 2.47, "text": "我会拍更多的视频给大家"}, {"t": 856.23, "d": 2.03, "text": "那今天的视频就到这儿了"}, {"t": 858.27, "d": 1.83, "text": "感谢大家看到这里"}, {"t": 860.1, "d": 2.03, "text": "我们下个视频见，拜拜"}], "en_cues": [{"t": 1.13, "d": 2.4, "text": "Hi everyone"}, {"t": 3.7, "d": 5.3, "text": "Today I want to teach you 10 expressions that Chinese people often say"}, {"t": 9.0, "d": 4.83, "text": "But you can't learn them in textbooks"}, {"t": 14.0, "d": 3.13, "text": "If you're interested, keep watching"}, {"t": 17.27, "d": 1.8, "text": "First one"}, {"t": 24.87, "d": 3.13, "text": "In textbooks, you might learn"}, {"t": 28.0, "d": 1.33, "text": "I'm tired"}, {"t": 29.33, "d": 1.37, "text": "I'm very tired"}, {"t": 30.7, "d": 1.83, "text": "I'm dead tired."}, {"t": 32.67, "d": 2.07, "text": "But in everyday life,"}, {"t": 34.73, "d": 3.33, "text": "you might hear people say it like this:"}, {"t": 38.07, "d": 3.73, "text": "Ugh, I'm really dead tired today!"}, {"t": 41.8, "d": 4.3, "text": "\"Dead tired,\" meaning tired like a dog."}, {"t": 46.33, "d": 2.2, "text": "This isn't an insult."}, {"t": 48.53, "d": 3.43, "text": "It's just an exaggerated expression."}, {"t": 52.33, "d": 2.93, "text": "If you're a working professional,"}, {"t": 55.27, "d": 3.5, "text": "Today is a very busy day for you."}, {"t": 58.77, "d": 2.27, "text": "From morning to afternoon,"}, {"t": 61.03, "d": 1.67, "text": "you have meetings all the time."}, {"t": 62.73, "d": 3.3, "text": "You keep having meetings, meetings, and more meetings."}, {"t": 66.13, "d": 2.7, "text": "Then you can complain to your friend,"}, {"t": 68.97, "d": 2.77, "text": "Ah, I'm really exhausted today!"}, {"t": 71.93, "d": 3.97, "text": "Your friend will immediately understand how tired you are today."}, {"t": 76.3, "d": 2.37, "text": "The second expression is"}, {"t": 84.37, "d": 3.53, "text": "In textbooks, what you might learn is"}, {"t": 88.1, "d": 1.6, "text": "I'm very happy"}, {"t": 89.7, "d": 1.43, "text": "I'm very glad"}, {"t": 91.13, "d": 2.43, "text": "Today is really great"}, {"t": 93.8, "d": 1.97, "text": "But in daily life"}, {"t": 95.77, "d": 2.17, "text": "Chinese people often say"}, {"t": 97.93, "d": 1.77, "text": "Wow, that's awesome!"}, {"t": 100.1, "d": 5.93, "text": "Meaning extremely happy, satisfied, and comfortable"}, {"t": 106.37, "d": 1.0, "text": "For example,"}, {"t": 107.37, "d": 1.8, "text": "it's summer now."}, {"t": 109.17, "d": 3.17, "text": "The temperature is high, it's very hot."}, {"t": 112.47, "d": 1.03, "text": "Think about it,"}, {"t": 113.5, "d": 4.67, "text": "in summer, during the hottest part of the afternoon,"}, {"t": 118.57, "d": 2.73, "text": "35 or 36 degrees,"}, {"t": 121.3, "d": 2.43, "text": "in very, very hot weather,"}, {"t": 123.9, "d": 4.2, "text": "you suddenly drink an iced coffee."}, {"t": 128.1, "d": 2.07, "text": "or iced milk tea"}, {"t": 130.17, "d": 2.23, "text": "or iced beer"}, {"t": 135.83, "d": 4.2, "text": "Ah! So satisfying!"}, {"t": 140.63, "d": 4.77, "text": "It means you are very content, comfortable, and happy"}, {"t": 145.67, "d": 1.4, "text": "Another example"}, {"t": 147.07, "d": 3.0, "text": "If you get a week off"}, {"t": 150.4, "d": 2.07, "text": "No work for a week"}, {"t": 152.47, "d": 3.9, "text": "Wouldn't you also say \"So satisfying!\""}, {"t": 157.1, "d": 2.3, "text": "The third expression is"}, {"t": 165.9, "d": 2.5, "text": "This expression is quite long"}, {"t": 168.4, "d": 6.8, "text": "It describes a state of being very nervous and flustered"}, {"t": 175.47, "d": 3.17, "text": "In textbooks, what you might learn is"}, {"t": 178.63, "d": 1.1, "text": "I'm very nervous"}, {"t": 179.73, "d": 1.57, "text": "I'm very flustered"}, {"t": 181.3, "d": 2.1, "text": "But in real life"}, {"t": 183.4, "d": 1.9, "text": "Many people say it like this"}, {"t": 185.3, "d": 2.9, "text": "In my heart, I'm a total mess."}, {"t": 189.6, "d": 2.07, "text": "'Huang' means 'panicked'."}, {"t": 191.67, "d": 2.87, "text": "'De yi pi' doesn't really mean anything."}, {"t": 194.53, "d": 3.3, "text": "It just adds emphasis."}, {"t": 198.07, "d": 2.0, "text": "Let me give you a scenario."}, {"t": 200.07, "d": 2.17, "text": "You've just started learning Chinese."}, {"t": 202.27, "d": 3.1, "text": "You're chatting with a Chinese person for the first time."}, {"t": 205.37, "d": 2.83, "text": "He speaks Chinese really fast."}, {"t": 208.2, "d": 1.27, "text": "You're nervous"}, {"t": 209.47, "d": 1.37, "text": "You're panicking"}, {"t": 210.83, "d": 1.4, "text": "You can say"}, {"t": 212.23, "d": 4.13, "text": "Ah, at that moment I was really panicking!"}, {"t": 216.5, "d": 1.63, "text": "I've always thought"}, {"t": 218.13, "d": 2.17, "text": "when learning Chinese"}, {"t": 220.3, "d": 5.93, "text": "you should learn real, natural, and authentic expressions"}, {"t": 226.23, "d": 3.03, "text": "That's why I've always recommended that everyone"}, {"t": 229.27, "d": 2.1, "text": "In the process of learning Chinese,"}, {"t": 231.37, "d": 3.67, "text": "you really, really must practice conversations with native speakers."}, {"t": 235.03, "d": 1.5, "text": "And in this regard,"}, {"t": 236.53, "d": 3.8, "text": "italki has really helped us out a lot."}, {"t": 311.7, "d": 2.83, "text": "You can buy lessons one by one,"}, {"t": 314.53, "d": 3.6, "text": "you don't need to stock up on a bunch of lessons at once."}, {"t": 318.13, "d": 2.0, "text": "The scheduling is also pretty flexible,"}, {"t": 320.13, "d": 3.0, "text": "so that way, the pressure on you will be much less."}, {"t": 323.33, "d": 2.17, "text": "If you're a new user,"}, {"t": 325.5, "d": 6.7, "text": "you can use my promo code now to get $5 off a $10 purchase."}, {"t": 332.33, "d": 2.27, "text": "This is really a great deal."}, {"t": 334.63, "d": 3.9, "text": "I hope this can help you all learn Chinese."}, {"t": 341.93, "d": 3.37, "text": "The fourth expression is"}, {"t": 347.23, "d": 5.97, "text": "'Niu,' yes, that animal, 'niu'."}, {"t": 353.2, "d": 4.47, "text": "In China, 'niu' can also be used to describe someone who is really impressive."}, {"t": 357.67, "d": 2.1, "text": "meaning they did a great job."}, {"t": 359.77, "d": 3.77, "text": "In textbooks, the expression you might learn is"}, {"t": 363.53, "d": 1.73, "text": "You're great!"}, {"t": 365.33, "d": 3.73, "text": "But Chinese people often say in daily life"}, {"t": 369.07, "d": 1.9, "text": "Awesome!\" \"That's amazing!"}, {"t": 370.97, "d": 5.03, "text": "If your friend runs a marathon for the first time"}, {"t": 376.23, "d": 1.8, "text": "and gets first place"}, {"t": 378.03, "d": 2.03, "text": "wouldn't you say he's awesome?"}, {"t": 380.07, "d": 3.13, "text": "You'd definitely give him a thumbs up."}, {"t": 383.2, "d": 2.03, "text": "Just say 'Awesome!'"}, {"t": 385.87, "d": 2.73, "text": "The fifth expression is"}, {"t": 395.67, "d": 1.63, "text": "the sky is falling"}, {"t": 397.43, "d": 2.73, "text": "which means something bad happened"}, {"t": 400.17, "d": 3.27, "text": "It's not just a small problem"}, {"t": 403.43, "d": 2.47, "text": "something big happened"}, {"t": 406.0, "d": 2.97, "text": "It means things are very serious"}, {"t": 409.1, "d": 3.97, "text": "Of course, sometimes it's just a joke"}, {"t": 413.13, "d": 1.8, "text": "exaggerate as a joke"}, {"t": 415.03, "d": 1.73, "text": "maybe the situation isn't that serious"}, {"t": 416.77, "d": 3.37, "text": "but I can exaggerate it even more"}, {"t": 420.13, "d": 1.1, "text": "the sky is falling"}, {"t": 421.23, "d": 1.43, "text": "the sky has fallen"}, {"t": 424.23, "d": 2.6, "text": "let me give you a scenario"}, {"t": 427.67, "d": 1.57, "text": "when you go to the bathroom"}, {"t": 429.23, "d": 3.67, "text": "do you have the habit of scrolling on your phone?"}, {"t": 432.9, "d": 2.33, "text": "Do you have the habit of scrolling on your phone?"}, {"t": 435.37, "d": 3.03, "text": "I've done it more than once, I should say."}, {"t": 438.83, "d": 2.3, "text": "I scroll on my phone while using the restroom."}, {"t": 441.13, "d": 2.73, "text": "Then when I stood up, \"plop\""}, {"t": 443.93, "d": 3.43, "text": "The phone fell into the toilet."}, {"t": 447.53, "d": 4.17, "text": "At that moment, I felt like the sky was falling."}, {"t": 451.7, "d": 3.73, "text": "The sky is falling, my phone fell into the toilet."}, {"t": 455.43, "d": 2.0, "text": "The sky has truly fallen."}, {"t": 458.57, "d": 1.5, "text": "Did everyone learn that?"}, {"t": 460.3, "d": 2.53, "text": "The sixth expression."}, {"t": 468.2, "d": 4.0, "text": "Here, \"fú le\" doesn't mean \"to admire.\""}, {"t": 472.23, "d": 2.23, "text": "It means something happened"}, {"t": 474.47, "d": 3.03, "text": "that makes you feel really speechless."}, {"t": 477.63, "d": 2.33, "text": "Let me give you an example."}, {"t": 480.1, "d": 2.5, "text": "If you have a roommate"}, {"t": 482.9, "d": 1.93, "text": "who often forgets to bring his keys."}, {"t": 484.9, "d": 3.8, "text": "Your door needs a key to open."}, {"t": 488.97, "d": 2.0, "text": "The first time he forgets his key,"}, {"t": 490.97, "d": 1.47, "text": "he calls you,"}, {"t": 492.57, "d": 4.2, "text": "Ah, sorry, I left my key at the office."}, {"t": 496.77, "d": 3.03, "text": "Can you come back and open the door for me?"}, {"t": 500.43, "d": 3.73, "text": "Then you'd say... well, it's okay, I can go help him, right?"}, {"t": 504.17, "d": 2.53, "text": "Because it's the first time this has happened,"}, {"t": 506.7, "d": 2.73, "text": "But if in the next week"}, {"t": 509.43, "d": 4.0, "text": "He had this happen three times in a row"}, {"t": 513.67, "d": 2.67, "text": "You'd start to feel speechless"}, {"t": 516.33, "d": 2.53, "text": "How can he be so forgetful"}, {"t": 518.87, "d": 1.8, "text": "I'm really done with this"}, {"t": 520.67, "d": 3.57, "text": "Three times in one week"}, {"t": 524.33, "d": 2.1, "text": "I'm really done with this!"}, {"t": 526.87, "d": 4.03, "text": "Next, the seventh expression is"}, {"t": 535.7, "d": 3.53, "text": "Yeah, it has three English letters in the middle"}, {"t": 539.23, "d": 3.63, "text": "EMO comes from the English word emotion"}, {"t": 543.0, "d": 4.2, "text": "It expresses sadness, sorrow"}, {"t": 547.2, "d": 3.17, "text": "feeling down, or in a bad mood"}, {"t": 550.63, "d": 2.83, "text": "In textbooks, you might learn"}, {"t": 553.47, "d": 1.73, "text": "I'm sad"}, {"t": 555.2, "d": 1.43, "text": "I'm very upset"}, {"t": 556.63, "d": 2.03, "text": "I'm in a bad mood"}, {"t": 558.67, "d": 2.93, "text": "But in real life"}, {"t": 561.6, "d": 1.57, "text": "Especially young people"}, {"t": 563.17, "d": 5.73, "text": "They really like to use expressions like \"I'm feeling emo!\""}, {"t": 569.2, "d": 1.77, "text": "I have a friend"}, {"t": 570.97, "d": 2.67, "text": "I often call him Emo Bro"}, {"t": 573.63, "d": 1.1, "text": "Why"}, {"t": 574.73, "d": 3.97, "text": "Because he often gets emo at night"}, {"t": 578.97, "d": 2.67, "text": "At night, he doesn't want to sleep"}, {"t": 581.63, "d": 2.1, "text": "Listening to sad songs"}, {"t": 583.73, "d": 2.67, "text": "Looking at messages on his phone"}, {"t": 586.57, "d": 3.1, "text": "Feeling sad, upset, and lost"}, {"t": 589.8, "d": 5.03, "text": "Then he'll post some very melancholic updates"}, {"t": 594.97, "d": 2.0, "text": "He really loves to be emo"}, {"t": 596.97, "d": 2.9, "text": "So I gave him a nickname: \"Emo Bro\""}, {"t": 600.03, "d": 3.8, "text": "Now we've reached the 8th expression"}, {"t": 608.63, "d": 2.5, "text": "You might ask: There's something?"}, {"t": 611.23, "d": 1.73, "text": "What something"}, {"t": 613.47, "d": 1.6, "text": "What does this phrase mean?"}, {"t": 615.07, "d": 6.57, "text": "Actually, it means not bad, better than expected."}, {"t": 621.93, "d": 2.03, "text": "It's got something to it."}, {"t": 624.17, "d": 4.07, "text": "One day, your friend takes you to a restaurant."}, {"t": 628.57, "d": 2.03, "text": "You don't really have high expectations."}, {"t": 630.6, "d": 5.2, "text": "The restaurant's appearance is also pretty ordinary."}, {"t": 635.8, "d": 1.27, "text": "You sit down."}, {"t": 637.07, "d": 2.03, "text": "Then you order dishes."}, {"t": 639.23, "d": 2.8, "text": "The food arrives, you take a bite,"}, {"t": 643.57, "d": 1.2, "text": "and you're amazed."}, {"t": 644.77, "d": 2.23, "text": "It's better than you expected,"}, {"t": 648.2, "d": 1.57, "text": "pretty good,"}, {"t": 649.77, "d": 0.9, "text": "quite nice,"}, {"t": 650.67, "d": 1.47, "text": "pretty impressive."}, {"t": 652.13, "d": 1.53, "text": "Then you can say,"}, {"t": 653.67, "d": 2.47, "text": "Hey, this place has some real stuff!"}, {"t": 656.53, "d": 2.5, "text": "This place has something to it"}, {"t": 659.53, "d": 2.97, "text": "The ninth expression"}, {"t": 665.53, "d": 3.4, "text": "Or, to be... obsessed with something"}, {"t": 669.4, "d": 2.57, "text": "shàng tóu"}, {"t": 673.27, "d": 1.03, "text": "Its meaning is"}, {"t": 674.3, "d": 4.27, "text": "It means liking or being addicted to something"}, {"t": 678.57, "d": 2.23, "text": "shàng tóu"}, {"t": 680.93, "d": 1.6, "text": "Nowadays, TikTok"}, {"t": 682.53, "d": 1.63, "text": "Many people are hooked on TikTok."}, {"t": 684.17, "d": 4.27, "text": "Because scrolling through videos is a very addictive behavior."}, {"t": 688.43, "d": 2.9, "text": "An easily addictive behavior."}, {"t": 691.43, "d": 1.7, "text": "This is 'hooked'."}, {"t": 693.13, "d": 3.43, "text": "I've been scrolling on my phone for the whole night."}, {"t": 696.57, "d": 1.87, "text": "I can't stop."}, {"t": 698.43, "d": 1.9, "text": "I'm so hooked."}, {"t": 700.33, "d": 3.33, "text": "Short videos are so addictive."}, {"t": 703.8, "d": 1.93, "text": "Then if you say,"}, {"t": 705.73, "d": 5.6, "text": "I'm hooked on him now!"}, {"t": 711.57, "d": 0.97, "text": "what does that mean?"}, {"t": 712.53, "d": 4.6, "text": "It means you really like this person right now."}, {"t": 717.23, "d": 2.2, "text": "You're fascinated by him."}, {"t": 719.43, "d": 1.33, "text": "You like him a lot."}, {"t": 720.77, "d": 2.1, "text": "I'm hooked on him."}, {"t": 722.97, "d": 1.23, "text": "Got it?"}, {"t": 724.43, "d": 1.33, "text": "The last one"}, {"t": 730.67, "d": 5.23, "text": "You might notice another English word here - CPU"}, {"t": 736.77, "d": 4.67, "text": "Do you know that a CPU is a component of a computer?"}, {"t": 741.43, "d": 2.07, "text": "The central processing unit"}, {"t": 743.73, "d": 3.97, "text": "Burn here doesn't mean burning with fire"}, {"t": 747.77, "d": 3.33, "text": "It means damaged, no longer usable"}, {"t": 751.1, "d": 1.5, "text": "The CPU is fried"}, {"t": 752.6, "d": 2.23, "text": "If your computer's CPU is broken"}, {"t": 754.83, "d": 2.1, "text": "The computer can't be used."}, {"t": 757.0, "d": 2.03, "text": "Right, it's unusable."}, {"t": 759.17, "d": 1.43, "text": "In daily life,"}, {"t": 760.6, "d": 2.07, "text": "when we say this phrase,"}, {"t": 762.87, "d": 2.13, "text": "besides being used for computers,"}, {"t": 765.0, "d": 4.07, "text": "it can also be applied to your brain."}, {"t": 770.0, "d": 1.17, "text": "What does that mean?"}, {"t": 771.17, "d": 5.33, "text": "'CPU burned' means something that's mentally taxing or brain-burning."}, {"t": 776.57, "d": 1.23, "text": "Very complicated situations"}, {"t": 777.8, "d": 1.43, "text": "You can't figure it out"}, {"t": 779.23, "d": 2.63, "text": "You can use the expression \"CPU burned out\""}, {"t": 782.17, "d": 1.2, "text": "For example"}, {"t": 783.37, "d": 3.27, "text": "You have a friend who is a programmer"}, {"t": 786.63, "d": 3.6, "text": "He is very good at writing code"}, {"t": 790.23, "d": 3.23, "text": "But code is very difficult for you"}, {"t": 793.47, "d": 3.53, "text": "It's like reading an alien script, you can't understand it"}, {"t": 797.17, "d": 1.4, "text": "He explains to you"}, {"t": 798.57, "d": 1.03, "text": "why this is"}, {"t": 799.6, "d": 1.3, "text": "why that is"}, {"t": 800.9, "d": 2.0, "text": "You listen very carefully"}, {"t": 802.9, "d": 2.67, "text": "but you just can't understand"}, {"t": 805.57, "d": 1.13, "text": "can't wrap your head around it"}, {"t": 806.7, "d": 2.37, "text": "your brain can't keep up"}, {"t": 809.07, "d": 2.0, "text": "Oh, stop telling me about it"}, {"t": 811.07, "d": 2.47, "text": "My CPU is fried."}, {"t": 813.77, "d": 3.57, "text": "It means you can't figure something out."}, {"t": 817.33, "d": 1.93, "text": "Your brain can't process it."}, {"t": 819.27, "d": 3.57, "text": "But it's a very vivid expression."}, {"t": 822.93, "d": 3.57, "text": "If your Chinese friends hear you say this,"}, {"t": 826.5, "d": 2.23, "text": "they will definitely be amused."}, {"t": 829.07, "d": 4.2, "text": "Did you learn all 10 expressions today?"}, {"t": 833.27, "d": 3.13, "text": "Find a chance to use them with your Chinese friends"}, {"t": 836.4, "d": 5.13, "text": "Or say these phrases to your Chinese teacher."}, {"t": 841.63, "d": 3.1, "text": "See how they react."}, {"t": 845.47, "d": 2.1, "text": "If you want to learn more,"}, {"t": 847.57, "d": 3.47, "text": "authentic, natural, and real Chinese like this,"}, {"t": 851.03, "d": 2.47, "text": "please give me a thumbs up."}, {"t": 853.63, "d": 2.47, "text": "I'll make more videos for you."}, {"t": 856.23, "d": 2.03, "text": "That's it for today's video."}, {"t": 858.27, "d": 1.83, "text": "Thank you for watching till the end."}, {"t": 860.1, "d": 2.03, "text": "See you in the next video, bye!"}], "video_id": "eS1ifIhEEZ0"}